  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gBbFK1h.png\" width=\"1315\" height=\"685\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&amp;label=Twitter&amp;logo=twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=f&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"about\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們都知道 Minecraft 可以擁有更多樣化的圍欄、牆壁和大門。嗯，我想我有好消息要告訴你！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個模組新增了木製圍欄、大門、石牆、石門、特殊的帶電圍欄（會造成傷害）。最新的 1.1.0 版本新增了石柱牆、<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">覆草石牆和鹿角障礙物（碰撞時會造成傷害）！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在評論區或我們的 Macaw's Discord 提出你的想法吧。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"video\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新的圍欄影片展示</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g3V3lcidXmU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mqOR-HOaI68?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">需要伺服器嗎？點擊上方圖片，使用我們的代碼 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong>，即可在首次訂閱時享受<strong> 25% </strong>折扣，快來體驗吧！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"faq\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">問：你們有計劃向下移植到 1.15.2 或更低版本嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可能性極低</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我可以在我的模組包中使用你們的模組嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需標註出處並附上 CurseForge 頁面連結即可</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我幫你們做了翻譯，要怎麼交給你們？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以透過 GitHub 或我們的 Discord 伺服器提交</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BOmxXo M.jpg\" width=\"1903\" height=\"2399\"></p>",
